&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:18.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;
text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;&lt;b&gt;Permitted Temporary Uses&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;

&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Notwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country
Planning (Use Classes) Order 1987 (as amended) or the Town and Country Planning
(General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) (or any Order
revoking, re-enacting or modifying that Order), the temporary development
hereby approved shall be used as Sui Generis – Temporary Residential Accommodation
only. The temporary development hereby approved shall not be used for any other
equivalent or similar purpose.&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:18.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;
text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Temporary Use Duration&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;

&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The use hereby permitted shall be discontinued and the site
restored to its former condition by removing all fixtures, fittings,
structures, and equipment on or before five (5) years from the grant of this temporary
planning permission.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:18.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;
text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Car Parking&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;

&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;
mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;
mso-fareast-language:EN-US&quot;&gt;Notwithstanding&amp;nbsp;the details submitted with the
application, prior to first occupation of the development, a Car Parking Design
and Management Plan shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local
Planning Authority. This shall include details of how parking will be allocated
and details of any measures to discourage private motorised vehicle use such as
charging regimes. Parking shall be made available for staff only and residents
shall not be eligible to use the car park. The agreed measures in the Car
Parking Design and Management Plan shall be implemented upon first occupation
and maintained thereafter in perpetuity.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:18.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;
text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cycle Parking &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;

&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Prior to first occupation, the 8no. cycle parking spaces
shown on plan - &lt;i&gt;Proposed Cycle Parking Details&lt;/i&gt; shall be provided in full
and thereafter maintained for the lifetime of the development. &amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:18.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;
text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Secured by Design &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;

&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The proposed development shall follow Secured by design
principles to the satisfaction of the local authority &amp;amp; Metropolitan
Police, details of which shall be provided to the Local Planning Authority for
its written approval prior to the first occupation of the approved development.
All approved security measures shall be implemented prior to first occupation and
permanently retained thereafter.&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:18.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;
text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Operation by LBBD only:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;

&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The temporary development hereby approved shall only be
operated by the London Borough of Barking and Dagenham for the duration of the development.
&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
